<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
<p class="usa-intro">Effective date: March 2026</p>
<h2 id="what-data-we-collect">What Data We Collect</h2>
<p><strong>Essentially nothing.</strong> PackagingConveyor.com has no user accounts, no contact forms, no comment system, and no newsletter signup. There is no mechanism on this site to collect your personal information.</p>
<p>We do not use Google Analytics, Facebook Pixel, or any other third-party tracking or analytics service. We do not track your behavior across pages or sessions.</p>
<h2 id="hosting-netlify">Hosting: Netlify</h2>
<p>This site is hosted on <strong>Netlify</strong>. Like any web host, Netlify's servers receive standard HTTP request data when you visit a page, your IP address, browser type, referring URL, and pages requested. This is logged at the infrastructure level for security and performance purposes.</p>
<p>We do not access or process these server logs for advertising or profiling. You can review Netlify's privacy policy at <a href="https://www.netlify.com/privacy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">netlify.com/privacy</a>.</p>
<h2 id="cookies">Cookies</h2>
<p>We do not set any first-party cookies. Netlify may set functional cookies as part of their CDN and edge network operations. We do not use cookies for advertising, retargeting, or analytics.</p>
<h2 id="external-links">External Links</h2>
<p>This site links to external websites, including manufacturer product pages, industry standards bodies (OSHA, ASME, NFPA, CEMA, FDA, 3-A SSI), and trade associations. These links open in new tabs and take you to sites we do not own or control.</p>
<p>External sites have their own privacy policies and may use cookies, analytics, and tracking technologies. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of any linked site. Review their policies before providing personal information.</p>
<h2 id="future-changes">Future Changes</h2>
<p>If we add contact forms, analytics, or any other feature that involves data collection, this policy will be updated before that feature goes live. The effective date at the top of this page will reflect the most recent revision.</p>
<h2 id="questions">Questions</h2>
<p>If you have questions about this privacy policy, contact us at <a href="mailto:info@packagingconveyor.com">info@packagingconveyor.com</a>.</p>
</BaseLayout>
